DESCRIPTION:Game Release: Adorable Adventures\\nGenre: Adventure\, Open World\, Simulation\, Indie\\nPlatforms: Xbox\, PC\, PS5\\n\\nAdorable Adventures\, tells the heart-warming story of Boris\, a curious baby boar searching for his family in the aftermath of a forest fire. Over the course of his adventure\, Boris will learn to harness his incredible sense of smell in order to navigate stunning natural landscapes and\, slowly but surely\, reunite with his scattered brothers and sisters.\\n\\nPowered by ZR Consulting — www.zrconsulting.de
